---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" page="download" title="Download Opaline - Public alpha" description="Download Opaline v0.1.2 and read build and updater notes.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">v0.1.2 public alpha</p>
      <h1>Download Opaline</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Opaline is in public alpha. The current release includes Windows and macOS Apple Silicon builds, and packages may still be unsigned or unnotarized.</p>
      <div class="page-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/miqiv99/opaline/releases/tag/v0.1.2" rel="noreferrer">Open GitHub Release</a>
        <a class="button" href="/docs/release">Build and update notes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell content-grid">
      <article class="notice">
        <h2>Before installing</h2>
        <ul class="fine-list">
          <li>Back up your workspace before testing alpha builds with important notes.</li>
          <li>Windows and macOS Apple Silicon assets are available for v0.1.2.</li>
          <li>Windows remains the primary development target; macOS builds are produced and tested on macOS.</li>
          <li>Unsigned or unnotarized packages can trigger Windows SmartScreen, Gatekeeper, or other platform warnings.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="license-box">
        <h2>Updater status</h2>
        <p>The Settings page includes a manual update check UI. The current GitHub Release metadata covers Windows x64 and macOS Apple Silicon assets.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
